{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1012701001:0":{"text":"伊米尔，束手就擒吧！","source_cn":"伊米尔，束手就擒吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B450ECFFFE85AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012701002:0":{"text":"住口！我才是有资格号令薄暮丛林的人！而你算什么东西……竟敢命令我！","source_cn":"住口！我才是有资格号令薄暮丛林的人！而你算什么东西……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79AE45345E7730D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012701003:0":{"text":"我生不逢时……才让你钻了空子！然而只要拥有薄暮丛林的力量……<style=\"highlight\">我将永生</style>！","source_cn":"我生不逢时……才让你钻了空子！然而只要拥有薄暮丛林的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADEAAD52F4CDBF9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012701004:0":{"text":"丛林的生命力不属于你，所有的叶子终将枯萎，面对你的命运吧！","source_cn":"丛林的生命力不属于你，所有的叶子终将枯萎，面对你的命运吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA8BFC701551352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012701005:0":{"text":"闭上你的嘴！烂在土里是达赫妮跟雅顿的命运！不是我！","source_cn":"闭上你的嘴！烂在土里是达赫妮跟雅顿的命运！不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028DA4F28DFA5DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu